Minor nit: for an invalid zero-value `netip.Addr{}`, `addr != header.IPv4Any` evaluates to true. We could simplify this using `netip.Addr` methods:

```suggestion
func isSpecified(addr netip.Addr) bool {
	return addr.IsValid() && !addr.IsUnspecified()
}
```
